  ------------------------------------------------------------
    how to run
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      Double-click intro.html in Edge or Chrome on Windows
      10 or 11, wait for the bar, then click. No server, no
      flags. ESC leaves fullscreen. A discrete GPU is
      recommended. Tested on an RTX 5090.

